      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "callActivity Call_OptionsAnalysis",
      "prov:value": "Note where this is NOT. The work-plan named `crdm-requirements-workflow`, and `A_Implement` is not in that diagram — `crdm-requirements.bpmn` is the orchestrator, seven call activities and a gateway, and Phase 6 lives here in `crdm-deliver.bpmn`. The call goes where the step is, not where the plan said to look."
    },
    {
      "@id": "processes/process/crdm-deliver.bpmn#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "endEvent End_Process_CRDM_Deliver",
      "prov:value": "THERE IS NO THEME REVIEW HERE ANY MORE, and that is a ruling rather than an omission. Until 2026-09-24 the `accepted` branch ran `Call_ThemeUIReview`, a post-MVP theme and UI review, before the phase closed. The owner moved it: theme review happens at INGESTION ONLY — \"theme review to ingestion of graphical assets in context of website or app design and determining graphical assets/UI\", confirmed \"Yes only at ingestion\" (bean `9fdi`). It is now called from `ingest-theme.bpmn`, where the graphical assets arrive and are determined, rather than here, where they have already been built into what shipped. A reader looking for the review should go there.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean 9fdi",
        "2026-09-24"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-24"
      ]
